# Architecture

**Project:** STEP – Segmented Teaching for Every Person
**Status:** Draft. Items marked *planned* are not built yet.

## 1. System Context

STEP is a standalone web application that works alongside an existing LMS. An instructor can link a course page in the LMS to STEP, and students study there. It is not an LMS plug-in. A future path is LTI integration, which would let STEP be launched from inside Moodle, Canvas, or Blackboard.

| Actor | What they do in STEP |
|---|---|
| Instructor | Uploads lessons, adjusts and confirms segments, writes check-in questions, publishes, and views drop-off counts |
| Student | Enrolls, studies one segment at a time, answers check-in questions, switches formats, saves preferences, and tracks progress |

